                                        "entry_id": "daaae361-6c51-345e-a3a8-129c87eb9fce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Expounding right-wing views in a cool way; based."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8aec55d-aa7c-4783-8931-16842db1a0ee",
                                                "sense_id": "68d47a17-576b-3c28-9491-7daf0f381b64",
                                                "text": "His house organ Breitbart and a host of Trump-right websites and news outlets sang praises to his dank genius."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58795bdb-170f-4bd8-b7a2-91c92b6786c0",
                                                "sense_id": "68d47a17-576b-3c28-9491-7daf0f381b64",
                                                "text": "One thing that always brings me joy at this time of year is to spot a really dank meme. Or seeing the number of plays on my Jordan Peterson podcast, or beholding one of my mutuals get traction on X with a thread on Cultural Marxism and Gender Ideology[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "dank",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e9ec988-7742-386b-8b66-a81e28ef75ac",
                                        "entry_id": "7f904330-340e-3b30-a181-50c6a2c6dfff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moisture; humidity; water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e16ce575-1a94-4c62-b11d-ca97804427e9",
                                                "sense_id": "0e9ec988-7742-386b-8b66-a81e28ef75ac",
                                                "text": "The ravviſh danke of clumzie vvinter ramps / The fluent ſummers vaine: and drizling ſleete / Chilleth the vvan bleak cheek of the numd earth, / VVhilſt ſnarling guſts nibble the iuyceles leaues, / From the nak't ſhuddring branch; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f506ad09-1f16-482a-9811-c9ebb30e3c60",
                                                "sense_id": "0e9ec988-7742-386b-8b66-a81e28ef75ac",
                                                "text": "Yet oft they quit | The dank, and rising on siff pennons, tow'r | the mid aerial sky"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bda341fe-aa28-338d-b093-3fd775116359",
                                        "entry_id": "7f904330-340e-3b30-a181-50c6a2c6dfff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dankness; a dark, moist and usually unpleasant atmosphere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c1a39f2-7e55-49be-a351-5a4545b74c85",
                                                "sense_id": "bda341fe-aa28-338d-b093-3fd775116359",
                                                "text": "You ain't thinking of getting rid of the dank, are you, Moe?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d15072f-7a72-4856-825d-3c2fb356397d",
                                                "sense_id": "bda341fe-aa28-338d-b093-3fd775116359",
                                                "text": "Out of curiosity I follow him down into the dank of the basement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "220fe35f-65e6-41a6-ac6a-3637050e874c",
                                                "sense_id": "bda341fe-aa28-338d-b093-3fd775116359",
                                                "text": "Now, though, there was a sound that seemed quite out of place there in the dank of the forest. It was the most beautiful, harmonious sound that Susie had ever heard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ff693c8-bf77-32fe-839a-85959892ec3f",
                                        "entry_id": "7f904330-340e-3b30-a181-50c6a2c6dfff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Strong, high-quality cannabis."
                                        ],
